OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be murky to start in
OL,6,Finland areas, but dry for all today
OL,7,Fwith plenty of sunny spells near
OL,8,Fcoasts. Winds remain light throughout
OL,9,Fand feeling slightly chillier than
OL,10,FThursday.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with clear skies tonight,
OL,13,Fwith a chillier night than last night
OL,14,Fand light winds leading to widespread
OL,15,Ffrost and patchy freezing fog mostly
OL,16,Fin inland areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
